{"nodes": [{"id": "deckrecipe_doc", "label": "day-deck-recipe.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L1-7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "How to build day-NN.html for days 2-10 without re-deciding anything Day 1 already settled."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_day1_not_template", "label": "Day 1 is not the template", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L5-7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Day 1 carries ~18 slides of one-time onboarding (package tour, legend, Claude Code basics, skills map, 29-task map) that never recur; days 2-10 are much smaller and share one skeleton."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_skeleton", "label": "Day deck skeleton (days 2-10)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L11-29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cover; two day-plan slides; goals; theory slides per section each followed by that section's recording slide; break \u00ab\u0639\u0645\u0644\u0643 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639\u0643\u00bb; \u00ab\u062f\u0648\u0631\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646\u00bb checklist; break \u00ab\u0645\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0639\u0629 \u0648\u0639\u0631\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0642\u062f\u0645\u00bb; review; tomorrow."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_goals_last", "label": "Goals slide comes LAST in the plan block", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00ab\u0623\u0647\u062f\u0627\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0645\u00bb follows the tasks, never precedes them (CLAUDE.md A.6.8)."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_day_plan_slides", "label": "Slides 2-3: day plan with .sess columns", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L14-15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Slide 2: \u0634\u0631\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0641\u0627\u0647\u064a\u0645 + \u062a\u0637\u0628\u064a\u0642 \u0645\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062f\u0631\u0628; slide 3: \u0639\u0645\u0644\u0643 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639\u0643 + \u0645\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0639\u0629; each a 2 x .sess block copied verbatim from the curriculum's ### 2.N rows."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_recording_slide", "label": "\u25b6 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0642\u0637\u0639: \u00a7A (stepvid recording slide)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L19-23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per section: the stepvid slide of that section's tasks performed for real; the trainer then re-runs it live with no slide."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_your_turn_checklist", "label": "\u00ab\u062f\u0648\u0631\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646\u00bb nested task checklist (light)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L25-26, L189-190", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nested checklist on a LIGHT surface, preceded by the \u0639\u0645\u0644\u0643 break; always the highest overflow risk in a day."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_closing_slides", "label": "Review and tomorrow slides", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L27-28", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00ab\u0645\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0639\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0645\u00bb then \u00ab\u063a\u062f\u064b\u0627 \u2014 \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0645 N+1\u00bb."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_two_break_slides", "label": "Two break slides from Day 2, never three", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L31-34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Explain and live are delivered interleaved, so there is no transition to mark between them, and the day opens on \u0634\u0631\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0641\u0627\u0647\u064a\u0645 so a 'we start now' slide there marks nothing. Day 1 is the exception and keeps three."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_interleaved_sessions", "label": "Both sessions run every day, together", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L38-48", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per section: (1) trainer explains the concepts, (2) the recording plays, (3) the trainer executes the same steps live. They are not alternatives and not two blocks. Day 1 is the only whole-day exception (its first session is course preparation that can't be re-executed live)."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_watched_not_rerun", "label": "Watched-not-re-run exception", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L50-59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A one-time, account-bound section is watched, not re-run live (step 3 drops; steps 1-2 stay). Test: would a second live performance produce anything? Deploying an already-deployed project does not. Known cases listed: \u00a716 first deploy (Day 3) and \u00a716.3 final redeploy (Day 10), decided 2026-09-25."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_exception_reearned_per_section", "label": "Exception is re-earned per section", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L61-66", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00a712 (Day 5) sits next to \u00a77.11.3 (Day 4), which the text says does get the exception, but \u00a712's task is neither one-time nor account-bound, so it doesn't. Check the test for the section in front of you instead of assuming it propagates. Note the 'Known cases' line omits \u00a77.11.3 although this passage says it gets the exception."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_say_it_on_slide", "label": "Watched sections: say it on the slide", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L68-73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The recording slide's title or badge must state it is watched and the day-plan session note must match; silently dropping the live third looks like an omission. Do not touch the minute budget: time goes to watching, explaining and answering."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_recording_not_yet_exist", "label": "Ship the slide anyway when the recording is missing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L80-84", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A day's recordings are usually filmed after its deck is built, and the steps are knowable from the curriculum's own numbered steps. Waiting is the wrong default and so is faking timestamps; use stepvid__video--soon."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_soon_placeholder_markup", "label": "stepvid__video--soon placeholder markup", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L86-97", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dashed box with <p class=stepvid__soon><span class=\"i i-clock\"></span>\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0642\u0637\u0639 \u062a\u062d\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0635\u0648\u064a\u0631</p>; steps use <span class=\"stepvid__mark stepvid__mark--idx\"> ordinals (the example shows an Arabic-Indic \u0661)."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_no_fake_timestamps", "label": "No <video>, no data-t, no time button while pending", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L99-104", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A dead 0:00 that seeks nowhere is a worse lie than an honest dashed box; initStepVideos skips a step with no data-t so the placeholder costs nothing at runtime. Write steps as the trainee will experience them (not a shot list) and log the planned filename and scope in MEDIA_SHOTLIST marked \u2b1c."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_after_filming_swap", "label": "After filming: swap box, convert ordinals, re-check frames", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L117-120", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Swap for a real <video>, turn every ordinal into its data-t, and re-check each step against extracted frames, not the transcript. Auto-generated summaries have been wrong about the editor, the paste target and an entire edited-out exchange."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_icon_set_closed", "label": "Icon set is closed (22 icons)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L111-115", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No video, film, camera or play icon exists; i-clock is the one for a \u062a\u062d\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0635\u0648\u064a\u0631 box. An undefined class i i-\u2026 renders nothing at all (a CSS mask with no source) and deckAudit will not catch it. Grep icons.css before using a new icon name."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_fixed_numbers_215", "label": "Every day totals 215 minutes plus 25 break", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L124-131", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stated at bootcamp_roadmap_and_curriculum.md:68 as fixed for every day. The four session durations on slides 2-3 must add up; never inflate a total, reallocate inside a band. Day 2: \u0634\u0631\u062d 48 + \u062a\u0637\u0628\u064a\u0642 58 + \u0639\u0645\u0644\u0643 82 + \u0645\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0639\u0629 27 = 215."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_build_order", "label": "Build order (seven steps)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L135-154", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "1 read the curriculum ### 2.N block first; 2 read the day's ## N sections; 3 grep \u00ab\u0635\u064a\u0627\u063a\u0629 \u0645\u0642\u062a\u0631\u062d\u0629\u00bb and account for every hit; 4 read the matching skills; 5 check where output lands in PRODUCT.md; 6 copy the skeleton and fill from day-01.html; 7 verify then sync the day's brief and MEDIA_SHOTLIST."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_build_step_curriculum_first", "label": "Step 1: copy task rows verbatim from curriculum", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L137-139", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Section number, duration and parenthetical note become slides 2-3 and the \u00ab\u062f\u0648\u0631\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646\u00bb checklist. The deck never invents a task."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_build_step_prompts_reach_slides", "label": "Step 3: every \u00ab\u0635\u064a\u0627\u063a\u0629 \u0645\u0642\u062a\u0631\u062d\u0629\u00bb must reach a slide", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L143-148", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ready-made prompts are half of the deliberate redundancy CLAUDE.md A.5 requires, and the slide is the half the trainee reads. Count before building and after. Incident: \u00a79's two prompts were missed while \u00a78's neighbouring pair were on slides, so nothing looked wrong."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_build_step_read_skill", "label": "Step 4: read the matching skill first", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L149-150", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The slides must not teach something the skill will contradict when Claude executes it live."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_build_step_check_productmd", "label": "Step 5: check where the output lands in PRODUCT.md", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L151-152", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If the slide promises a three-column table and PRODUCT.md has two, one of them is wrong; fix before shipping."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_subduration_rows", "label": "Sub-durations render as separate task rows", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L156-161", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A curriculum line like `12.1 15 \u062f \u00b7 12.2 10 \u062f \u00b7 12.3 12 \u062f \u00b7 12.4 46 \u062f` reads better as four .task rows on both the agenda slide and the checklist than force-fit into one task__t/task__d pair: same total, not crammed."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_task_keys", "label": "Task keys: same tasks in two places", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L165-172", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The day-plan rows and \u00ab\u062f\u0648\u0631\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646\u00bb are the same tasks; give each an explicit data-task-key so ticking either moves both and hang subtasks off the parent with data-parent. localStorage is namespaced by filename (sag-deck:day-02.html:tasks), so key names can be reused day to day."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_not_carried_across_days", "label": "What does not carry across days", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L176-183", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "data-ref cannot cross files, checkbox state is per file, and the \u061f window reads one template per slide, so a Day-1 term must be re-explained when Day 2 needs it."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_recap_slide_pattern", "label": "Restate in a short recap slide, not a pointer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L178-181", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Day 2's \u0627\u0644\u063a\u0627\u064a\u0629/\u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0635\u064a\u0629 recap exists for exactly this reason."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_verification", "label": "Verification (same gate as Day 1)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L187-208", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "deckAudit (nested checklist is highest risk), deckRefAudit = [], checkbox behaviour in a browser, register sweeps on the new file, every \u00ab\u0635\u064a\u0627\u063a\u0629 \u0645\u0642\u062a\u0631\u062d\u0629\u00bb on a slide, durations sum to 215, commands as .snipbox, offline, screenshot and read the cover, goals slide, each showcase slide and the checklist."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_register_sweeps", "label": "Register sweeps on the new file", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L196-203", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u0648+Latin glue = 0; \u00ab\u0637\u0631\u0641\u064a\u0629\u00bb = 0; the \u0633\u0648\u064a verb family (\u064a\u0633\u0648/\u062a\u0633\u0648/\u0646\u0633\u0648/\u0633\u0648\u0651) = 0; no row or title opening with a \u0648-word; singular address. Sweep the family, never one spelling: the first real family sweep (2026-09-25) found three live \u00ab\u062a\u0633\u0648\u0651\u064a\u00bb on Day 1. Known false positive: noun \u00ab\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u0648\u0651\u062f\u0629\u00bb."}, {"id": "deckrecipe_offline_check", "label": "Offline: no remote font/stylesheet/script/image", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L206-207", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same offline rule as the main skill checklist."}], "edges": [{"source": "deckrecipe_doc", "target": "deckrecipe_day1_not_template", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/references/day-deck-recipe.md", "source_location": "L1-7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deckrecipe_doc", "target": "deckrecipe_skeleton", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/bootcamp-deck/refere